       "text": "MIMETypedStream's finalizer always tries to close the InputStream.  In some cases, this can result in failed API-M operations due the stream being unexpectedly closed while it's being read().  This has been observed in higher load situations.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This is likely also an issue in the maintenance branch.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
